:303592,"en":"Let me see your face this year."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0140:b002:l029","ordinal":303593,"en":"Sher's Sher Külchoro"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0140:b002:l030","ordinal":303594,"en":"Let me make it clear,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0140:b002:l031","ordinal":303595,"en":"It was dry enough"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0140:b002:l032","ordinal":303596,"en":"Let me heal."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0140:b002:l033","ordinal":303597,"en":"Almambet son to Choro"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0140:b002:l034","ordinal":303598,"en":"I'm sorry to say,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0140:b002:l035","ordinal":303599,"en":"Drip the extinguished firewood,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0140:b002:l036","ordinal":303600,"en":"Raised his dead soul,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0140:b002:l037","ordinal":303601,"en":"Then I will return."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0140:b002:l038","ordinal":303602,"en":"With gold coins from the feet,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0140:b002:l039","ordinal":303603,"en":"With thousands of red camels,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0140:b002:l040","ordinal":303604,"en":"Azar with livestock,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0140:b003:l001","ordinal":303605,"en":"A spoonful of blood,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0140:b003:l002","ordinal":303606,"en":"Blue greens with meat left over,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0140:b003:l003","ordinal":303607,"en":"The medicine did not go away,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0140:b003:l004","ordinal":303608,"en":"There is no rabid power blood."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0140:b003:l005","ordinal":303609,"en":"My ashes are gone,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0140:b003:l006","ordinal":303610,"en":"There is no horse and slave,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0140:b003:l007","ordinal":303611,"en":"There is no significant Kyrgyz population,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0140:b003:l008","ordinal":303612,"en":"Ayash father Kyzylsart,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0140:b003:l009","ordinal":303613,"en":"If you can't help yourself"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0140:b003:l010","ordinal":303614,"en":"Kyazga, the son of a moose"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0140:b003:l011","ordinal":303615,"en":"There is no need to rush,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0140:b003:l012","ordinal":303616,"en":"This is Külchoro today"}]
